": "1830449300822153", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982610_1830449304155486_9105627070072408848_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0FTVoKSX2yAQ7kNvwEY9bJU&_nc_oc=AdmkW6_tWq-eARAsMOkQ0UtFX5_vvf8aKkIe5w1a8VWh2NVDZ5bmWYVcUWGvDjzdBCo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvprUxxMkTDgiCYekhsLj1QsaIA0NGH5r9Y_UcnE0ns3g&oe=699C384A"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-13.png", "id": "9449026898446045", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_9449026905112711_4579666727095828995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h85QmB4WvvMQ7kNvwGKBhj6&_nc_oc=AdlfieNUW_R4EFVvRUnl3KnHvUe7wEkQMzxNW2o8i344DhHGKs95uD3LNkpt6khOK_g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu20cj3JDcHTLk9sXwVIjTXAwXTCwJxc_YzQCOildRHGA&oe=699C4884"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-11.png", "id": "1969264830167481", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974803_1969264833500814_717700601129842921_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vo6RDSgt-UwQ7kNvwHXKhJc&_nc_oc=AdnL-R4OljLSPPgqg3ynsGY2F2VBBOKxtOvklpeRk3zf3vWAPw0zj7jgpHxFCuHL6D4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs9PRqTYZTZOMn3lNjaAWdy9idoINv7hMMRn6Tj0C9Qzw&oe=699C4E5E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer-Cover-Image-MINI.png", "id": "1128857345307826", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43997708_1128857348641159_7151441411599407678_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EWzrWG8JO2oQ7kNvwF9Wj1x&_nc_oc=AdmJsF7ZOCsxUtQkRTi7Ywc8s97IZqA2isb-FWOkPYhJFFR7ep_fA_Lx5vfBRuQ6Z8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftoKWwo8zxhE_QCyriwN_CB4a8jEmeP4WQoXAUp9dlsvA&oe=699C390C"}, "display_name": "Squingle Mini", "keywords": ["puzzle", "MR", "puzzling", "demo", "squingle"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udf00 Buy Squingle Mini for only $0.99 and save $2 on the full game when you upgrade!\n\nSquingle Mini, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing, glass-like sculpture that comes to life in either Mixed Reality or a fully immersive environment, offering an unmatched visual experience in the puzzle genre.\n\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 ACCESSIBILITY\nDesigned to be accessible for a wide range of players and skill levels, with intuitive controls and hand-tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c GLOBAL LEADERBOARD\nCompete on the Squingle Mini Leaderboard! See the sum of your best times across all levels and compare them with others around the globe.\n\n \n# \ud83d\udc7b RACE YOUR GHOST\nChallenge your best times on each level to improve your leaderboard rank for endless fun!\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf00 Immerse yourself in the world of Squingle, where every twist presents a new challenge! \ud83c\udf20", "short_description": "\ud83c\udf00 Buy Squingle Mini for only $0.99 and save $2 on the full game when you upgrade!\n\nSquingle Mini, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20"}]}, "developer_name": "Dr. Benjamin Outram ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://squingle.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRAL Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://squingle.com